senses.gloss:
निशा-रण (णं) 1.
n. Killing, slaughter;
night combat or attack.

नि-ष्काशित (तः-ता-तं)
a. Expelled;
placed; reviled; expanded.

नि-ष्कुषित (तः-ता-तं)
a. Expelled;
extracted, forced out.

नि-ष्टप्त (प्तः-प्ता-प्तं)
a. Well cooked;
bright, burnished.

निष्ठित (तः-ता-तं)
p. Fixed; certain;
staying in; devoted to.

नि-ष्पादन (नं-ना) 1.
m. n. Doing;
concluding; causing.

नि-स्तनी (नी) 3.
f. A pill, a bolus;
a kind of force meat ball.

नि-स्तल (लः-ला-लं)
a. Down, below;
round; trembling.
